+
+## 0.2.105-ce.1 (2026-07-19)
+
+### Upstream sync
+- Merged upstream v0.2.105: Grok 4.5 model support, event loop rewrite, MCP OAuth improvements, `/btw` command, line editor, dashboard refactor (364 files, +30K/-16K lines)
